# Request controller-to-base synchronization of costmap data.
# publish_global_costmap and publish_local_costmap are single-trigger:
#   when true, the base will publish the full costmap once.
# publish_incremental_updates is a switch:
#   when true, enables continuous incremental update publishing;
#   when false, stops incremental update publishing.
bool publish_global_costmap
bool publish_local_costmap
bool publish_incremental_updates
---
bool success
string message
